<http://data.silknow.org/object/abbb41db-c4fc-3739-8ee4-7ed6f768b8fb/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Ground of twilled silk once orange has faded to neutral yellow. Design of two hunting maidens with their dogs at a fountain is woven with linen wound with gilded skin, very much tarnished and worn. White silk used for faces and hands and blue silk used to represent water has almost entirely disappeared."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/abbb41db-c4fc-3739-8ee4-7ed6f768b8fb> .

